Like you could!

274
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:15,460
Like you could!

275
00:16:15,460 --> 00:16:16,460
Well, not just me!

276
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:23,460
I...

277
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:25,460
I'm never going to cry again!

278
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:26,460
I've decided!

279
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:28,460
What do you mean?

280
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,460
I'll do it too!

281
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:33,460
I'm going to become the Wizard King!

282
00:16:33,460 --> 00:16:38,460
I'll work hard and get strong so I can protect you and everybody else!

283
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:40,460
I'll do whatever it takes!

284
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:42,460
And I'll never give up!

285
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:43,460
I'll never give up!

286
00:16:52,460 --> 00:16:55,460
We'll fight to see who will be the Wizard King!

287
00:16:55,460 --> 00:16:56,460
Whatever it takes!

288
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:03,460
Okay, but it's still gonna be me.

289
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:05,460
Nah, the title's mine and you know it is!

290
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:07,460
It's mine for sure!

291
00:17:07,460 --> 00:17:08,460
Nuh-uh!

292
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:15,460
So...

293
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:18,460
You rookies feel like you got back to your roots or whatever?

294
00:17:18,460 --> 00:17:19,460
Yeah, it was awesome!

295
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:20,460
Thank you!

296
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:21,460
Thank you!

297
00:17:21,460 --> 00:17:22,460
Yes.

298
00:17:22,460 --> 00:17:23,460
Alright.

299
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:25,460
I'm feeling more motivated now as well.

300
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:30,460
I swear, I'll strengthen my magic and fortify my bonds with friends.

301
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:31,460
Same here!

302
00:17:31,460 --> 00:17:33,460
I'll give it my all!

303
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:36,460
And help to make the Black Bulls the greatest team ever!

304
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:41,460
Also, I'll break my curse and prove I'm worthy of Lady Phineas' hand!

305
00:17:41,460 --> 00:17:43,460
Let's do our best, guys!

306
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:46,460
By the way, Captain, did we recruit any new people?

307
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:48,460
Am I taking on a protege?

308
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:51,460
There was one that I kinda liked.

309
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:56,460
But then another squad snapped him up.

310
00:17:58,460 --> 00:18:02,460
Which means you two have to stay at the bottom for at least another whole year.

311
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:05,460
Come on, let's go.

312
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:19,460
I knew I'd find you here.

313
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:22,460
Ah, hello, Marks. This is a coincidence.

314
00:18:22,460 --> 00:18:28,460
I don't see what's so coincidental about you sneaking out of the castle yet again.

315
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:32,460
We should get back. Your work is constantly piling up.

316
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:34,460
I'm well aware. You know?

317
00:18:35,460 --> 00:18:36,460
Yes?

318
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:42,460
It's inspiring to see this many young people building their skills so they can join the Magic Knights and protect our land.

319
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:47,460
That's why I wanted to come here. The sight of it is extremely encouraging to me.

320
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:52,460
Yes, you're right. They give us hope, don't they?

321
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:57,460
Now then, shall we depart?

322
00:18:57,460 --> 00:19:03,460
I've been meaning to ask you, Marks, do you enjoy eating grilled violet snake?

323
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:05,460
Is that a real question?

324
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:10,460
If you do, I was thinking I could catch one and cook it for you soon.

325
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:12,460
That won't be necessary, sir.

326
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:16,460
Aw, I bet Asta would be more than happy to have some.

327
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:21,460
Yuno.

328
00:19:23,460 --> 00:19:25,460
I have something for you.

329
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:27,460
What is it?

330
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:33,460
It's my old pendant.

331
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:35,460
But how?

332
00:19:36,460 --> 00:19:38,460
A man named Revchi brought it.

333
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:40,460
Is that true?

334
00:19:47,460 --> 00:19:53,460
From what I understand, it was one of the many valuable artifacts that he and Gelder took when they robbed the Shadow Palace.

335
00:19:54,460 --> 00:20:00,460
He was probably afraid of what you would do to him if you ever discovered that he had it, so he thought it wise to return it.

336
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:04,460
I'm relieved to know that your magic stone is back in your hands.

337
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:06,460
Me too.

338
00:20:07,460 --> 00:20:09,460
I never expected he'd be the one to return it to me.

339
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:11,460
Strange.

340
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:14,460
I'm so happy for you.

341
00:20:15,460 --> 00:20:16,460
Today marks one year.

342
00:20:17,460 --> 00:20:18,460
You've been an irreplaceable asset.

343
00:20:19,460 --> 00:20:20,460
I'm grateful.

344
00:20:23,460 --> 00:20:24,460
Make me proud, you know.

345
00:20:25,460 --> 00:20:26,460
Now then, everyone's waiting.

346
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:28,460
Let's go.

347
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:41,460
All right, you ready?

348
00:20:42,460 --> 00:20:43,460
For more training?

349
00:20:43,460 --> 00:20:44,460
Heck yeah!

350
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:45,460
Are you crazy?

351
00:20:45,460 --> 00:20:46,460
No, we're partying tonight.

352
00:20:47,460 --> 00:20:48,460
Partying?

353
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:52,460
Yeah, it's the one year anniversary of you two joining the squad.

354
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:55,460
There's a lot going on right now.

355
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:58,460
But we wanted to do something for you at least.

356
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:01,460
Magna and the others should be back soon too.

357
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:03,460
Thank you guys!

358
00:21:03,460 --> 00:21:06,460
I guess I'll let you celebrate me if you want to.

359
00:21:07,460 --> 00:21:08,460
Okay.

360
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:12,460
Just for tonight, let's all forget about fighting and really let loose.

361
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:13,460
Yes, sir!

362
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:16,460
It's time to have some fun.

363
00:21:17,460 --> 00:21:19,460
A whole night of bonding with my best friends.

364
00:21:19,460 --> 00:21:20,460
Knock knock!

365
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:21,460
Hey Charmy, we're back!

366
00:21:21,460 --> 00:21:33,460
I've gotten a lot stronger in the past year.

367
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:40,460
Now.

368
00:21:42,460 --> 00:21:43,460
Better keep going.

369
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:50,460
I'll keep reaching greater heights until I become the Wizard King.

370
00:21:51,460 --> 00:21:53,460
I'll work as hard as I can.

371
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:57,460
And one day, I'll be the next Wizard King.

372
00:21:57,460 --> 00:21:58,460
At least you want to feel free.

373
00:21:58,460 --> 00:22:28,440
Thank you for listening.

374
00:22:28,460 --> 00:22:58,440
Thank you.

375
00:22:58,460 --> 00:23:03,360
まだ消せない誓い叫んでる 忘れないように叫んでる

376
00:23:03,360 --> 00:23:08,320
泣きたいほど遠くだって 全然届かなくても

377
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:12,940
信じる君は赤い手前を向いている

378
00:23:12,940 --> 00:23:19,180
だから枯れないように柄がって 描いた夢また歩き出せる

379
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:23,980
きっと僕を呼ぶ声だ

380
00:23:28,460 --> 00:23:58,440
ご視聴ありがとうございました

